--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4ccc8d62acfa6b458801fb65fa6e27a, type: 3}
  m_Name: CutsceneDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneDialogue
  lines:
  - characterName: Computer
    text: WARNING! WARNING! WARNING!
  - characterName: Mel
    text: "Sensors just lit up like crazy! There\u2019s an anomaly forming downtown!"
  - characterName: Kip
    text: Ha! Finally something interesting. I was starting to think they took the
      day off.
  - characterName: Ziv
    text: You're way too casual about this, any of these anomalies are massive and
      could injure hundreds of civilians.
  - characterName: Mel
    text: Looks like a big one this time. Sounds like the perfect excuse to take
      my mech for a spin.
  - characterName: Ziv
    text: "Careful. The readings are unstable. This isn\u2019t a normal slime outbreak...
      whatever\u2019s forming is building power up fast."
  - characterName: Ziv
    text: 'Mel, it''s all yours today. '
  - characterName: Kip
    text: Go get em!
  - characterName: Ziv
    text: You might want to hurry. The anomaly is already expanding toward the central
      district.
  - characterName: Mel
    text: Then what are we waiting for?
